flowchart LR
    A[Pressure\nAccelerometer\nGyroscope\nMagnetometer\nGPS] --> B[Sensor acquisition]
    B --> C[Depth estimation]
    B --> D[Motion + heading]
    B --> E[GPS quality check]

    C --> F[Live baseline\npressure-first depth]
    D --> G[Movement confidence\nheading estimate]
    E --> H[Local UKF state]

    F --> I[Dive state logic]
    G --> I
    H --> I

    I --> J[FIT recording]
    I --> K[UI status + risk]
    H --> L[Dead reckoning track]
    J --> M[Saved dive trace]
    L --> M
